            "text": "way. Recall that a subgroup G\u2032 of a group G is characteristic if f (G\u2032 ) \u2282 G\u2032 for all f \u2208"
          },
          {
            "line": 113,
            "text": "Aut(G). Fix a basepoint v0 \u2208 \u03a3pg,n . Regarding the basepoint v0 as a puncture, the group"
