          },
          {
            "line": 117,
            "text": "then Modp+1g,n acts on the finite-dimensional vector space H1 (K; Q)."
          },
          {
            "line": 118,
            "text": "    If S is the finite cover of \u03a3pg,n corresponding to K, then H1 (K; Q) \u223c         = H1 (S; Q). The"
          },
          {
            "line": 119,
            "text": "                                                                                  p+1"
          },
          {
            "line": 120,
            "text": "action of Modp+1"
          },
          {
            "line": 121,
            "text": "               g,n  on H 1 (K;  Q)  arises from   lifting mapping    classes on \u03a3 g,n to the cover S"
          },
          {
            "line": 122,
            "text": "                                              p+1                               p"
          },
          {
            "line": 123,
            "text": "(observe that this uses the fact that Modg,n fixes the basepoint v0 \u2208 \u03a3g,n \u2013 if there were no"
